  brand text face. Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors. SIL Open Font
  License 1.1; the license text is src/dashboard/assets/fonts/OFL.txt.
- Icon outlines from Heroicons 2 (src/dashboard/assets/index.html).
  Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc. MIT License.

The native app window (src/native) draws with the same Inter, as TrueType
instances of that file (src/native/fonts/Inter-Regular-latin.ttf and
